            "line": 1322,
            "text": "theorem regularAxialLag_eq {h j Λ : ℝ} {P0 a : ℝ → ℝ}\n    {f U V Pr : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ} (hs : IsNaturalSolution h j Λ P0 a f U V Pr)\n    (hΛ : 0 < Λ) {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : p ∈ domain Λ) (hX : p.1 ≠ 0) :\n    regularAxialLag h U V Pr p = -2 * NaturalAxisData.L h p.2 * partialY U p"
